{"id": "train-08-001", "text": "Nothing on my phone will go online today. Every app just spins and says there's no connection.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-002", "text": "I was on a flight last week and since I landed nothing loads. There's a little picture of a plane at the top of the screen.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-003", "text": "My kids pulled down the top of the screen and tapped some things, and now nothing on the internet works at all.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-004", "text": "WhatsApp messages won't send and Google won't open. I'm at home and I didn't change anything that I know of.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-005", "text": "How do I get the internet back on my phone? It worked yesterday.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-006", "text": "When I'm out of the house, none of my apps work. Maps just shows a gray grid with nothing on it.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-007", "text": "I think I turned off the mobile data by accident when I was cleaning up my phone. Now nothing works away from Wi-Fi.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-008", "text": "YouTube says I'm offline and so does my bank app. Even the weather won't update.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-009", "text": "The Wi-Fi symbol disappeared from the top of my phone and now I can't get on anything.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-010", "text": "I turned on some battery saving thing to make it last longer and now my apps won't connect to anything.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-011", "text": "My phone says it's connected to our home Wi-Fi with the full fan symbol, but no websites will open.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-012", "text": "It shows the name of my network and says connected, but YouTube just keeps loading forever.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-013", "text": "I'm on the library Wi-Fi and it says I'm connected, but Google won't load any pages.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-014", "text": "The Wi-Fi bars are all full, yet WhatsApp says connecting and never sends my messages.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-015", "text": "How do I fix this? It says I'm connected to Wi-Fi but nothing actually works.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-016", "text": "At my sister's house the phone joined her Wi-Fi and has a check mark, but my apps say there's no internet.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-017", "text": "My laptop works fine on the same Wi-Fi. My phone says it's connected too, but pages never load.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-018", "text": "After the internet company came to fix our router, my phone shows connected but I can't open anything.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-019", "text": "It says \"connected\" under our network name in the Wi-Fi list, but my bank app tells me to check my connection.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-020", "text": "Full signal on the Wi-Fi and still Google Maps won't load anything. It just sits there.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-021", "text": "My phone doesn't ring anymore. I keep finding missed calls and never heard a thing.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-022", "text": "My mom said she called me three times this morning and the phone didn't make a sound.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-023", "text": "When people call me on WhatsApp, I don't hear anything. I just see the missed call later.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-024", "text": "I think my phone is stuck on silent. How do I make it ring again?", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-025", "text": "The phone just buzzes a tiny bit when someone calls, but there's no ring at all.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-026", "text": "I missed a call from my doctor's office because the phone never rang. It was right next to me on the table.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-027", "text": "There's a little moon at the top of my screen and since then calls don't make any noise.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-028", "text": "After a movie where I turned the sound down, my phone hasn't rung once. I keep missing calls.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-029", "text": "Calls come in with no sound. The screen lights up but I only notice if I'm looking at it.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-030", "text": "I pushed the side button down during a meeting and now the ringer seems to be gone completely.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-031", "text": "I don't get my WhatsApp messages until I open the app. Then they all show up at once.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-032", "text": "My text messages come in hours late. People think I'm ignoring them.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-033", "text": "Gmail used to tell me when I had a new email, but now I have to open it to see anything.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-034", "text": "My bank app used to let me know when money came out of my account, but I don't get those alerts anymore.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-035", "text": "Nothing pops up at the top of my screen anymore when I get a message. I just find them later.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-036", "text": "How do I make my phone tell me when I get a new message again?", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-037", "text": "Facebook Messenger doesn't let me know when someone writes to me. I only see it when I go in.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-038", "text": "Since I cleaned up some storage, my apps stopped showing me anything until I open them.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-039", "text": "My messages arrive but they don't make a sound or show up on the screen. I only see them when I check.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-040", "text": "The doorbell camera app used to alert me when someone came to the door, but now it doesn't until I open it.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-041", "text": "My phone is talking out loud and saying everything I touch. How do I make it stop?", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-042", "text": "There's a green box around whatever I tap and a voice reads it to me. I can't open anything.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-043", "text": "I have to tap twice to open apps now and the phone keeps talking. I didn't turn this on.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-044", "text": "I can't scroll down with one finger anymore, and a woman's voice is reading the whole screen.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-045", "text": "I think I pressed both volume buttons for a while and now the phone narrates everything.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-046", "text": "My grandson was playing with my phone and now it reads every button out loud. I can't even unlock it properly.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-047", "text": "When I tap an app, it just says the name of it and puts a box around it instead of opening.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-048", "text": "How do I turn off TalkBack? I can't figure out how to get around the phone with it on.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-049", "text": "The phone keeps describing everything on the screen out loud and nothing works like normal.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-050", "text": "I tried to answer a text and the phone just kept reading the keyboard letters out loud to me.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-051", "text": "My screen suddenly went black and white. All the colors are gone.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-052", "text": "Everything on my phone looks like a photo negative. White is black and the pictures look scary.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-053", "text": "The whole screen has a weird yellow-green color to it, and it isn't just one app.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-054", "text": "My photos look gray now, like an old movie. How do I get the color back?", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-055", "text": "I was looking at something in settings and now all the colors on my phone are flipped.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-056", "text": "The screen looks washed out and gray. My kids' pictures in my gallery have no color.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-057", "text": "Ever since I updated the phone, everything has a strange pink tint that won't go away.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-058", "text": "YouTube videos look like they're in black and white, and so does everything else.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-059", "text": "How do I turn off grayscale? My phone looks like an old TV.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-060", "text": "The colors are all backwards. Faces look blue and the background turned dark.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-061", "text": "My screen is so dark I can barely see anything on it.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-062", "text": "When I'm outside I can't read my phone at all. It's way too dark.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-063", "text": "The phone keeps getting darker by itself even when I'm using it.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-064", "text": "I try to slide the brightness up but it won't stay up. It goes back down.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-065", "text": "How do I make my screen brighter? I have to squint to read my texts.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-066", "text": "I was trying to look at Google Maps in the car and couldn't see the screen at all, it was so dim.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-067", "text": "After I charged my phone overnight, the screen came on really dark and I can't make it lighter.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-068", "text": "Even with the lights on in my kitchen, the screen looks dull and dark.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-069", "text": "The screen dims down while I'm reading a recipe, and I have to keep tapping it.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-070", "text": "My brightness seems stuck at the lowest. I can't make out the numbers in my bank app.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-071", "text": "My screen goes black after just a few seconds if I don't touch it.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-08-072", "text": "I'm trying to follow a recipe and the phone keeps locking itself every few seconds.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-08", "persona": {"age": "adult", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "plain", "typos": "none"}}
